  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p>French version / Version française: <a target='_blank' href='https://geohub-fr.lio.gov.on.ca/datasets/lio::gestion-de-situations-durgence-historiques/about' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Gestion de situations d’urgence historiques | CarrefourGéo Ontario</a></p><p>Incidents may include:</p><ul><li>community evacuations</li><li>impacts to infrastructure or communities</li><li>continuity of operations disruptions</li><li>situations where MNR provided expertise, resources or assistance</li></ul><p>Not all records represent declared emergencies or emergency events.</p><p>Incidents fall into 1 of 10 type categories:</p><ul><li>dam failure</li><li>drought or low water</li><li>erosion</li><li>flood</li><li>forest fire</li><li>soil and bedrock instability</li><li>Petroleum Resource Center event</li><li>Emergency Management Ontario (EMO) requested assistance</li><li>continuity of operations event</li><li>other requested assistance</li></ul><p><strong>Limitations</strong><br />This dataset is not complete and includes the following gaps:</p><ul><li>data does not capture all incidents</li><li>data has not been updated</li><li>data accuracy has not been verified</li><li>records do not imply that an emergency occurred or was declared.</li></ul><p>The data is provided as is and should not be used beyond historical reference or context.</p><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Additional Documentation</strong></span></div><div><ul><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Emergency%20Management%20Historical%20Events%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Emergency Management Historical Events - Data Description (PDF)</span></a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Emergency Management Historical Events - Documentation.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Emergency Management Historical Events - Documentation (Word)</span></a></li></ul></div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Status</strong></span></div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Completed: Production of the data has been completed</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong></span></div><div>Not planned: there are no plans to update the data</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Contact</strong></span><br />Aviation, Forest Fire and Emergency Services, Emergency Management Unit</div><div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; max-width:100%; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'><ul><li><a href='mailto:meoc-emerg.mnr@ontario.ca' rel='nofollow ugc'><span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; display:inline !important; line-height:1.5; max-width:100%; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>meoc-emerg.mnr@ontario.ca</span></span></a><span style='font-family